% Chapter 6: two more relations, and the critters' legs.
% Kept out of pond.elpi; the chapter's other files load it.
accumulate pond.

% ANCHOR: places
kind place type.
type spring, brook, pond, river, sea place.
% ANCHOR_END: places

% ANCHOR: upstream
% upstream P Q: water runs from P into Q.
pred upstream o:place, o:place.
upstream spring brook.
upstream brook  pond.
upstream pond   river.
upstream river  sea.
% ANCHOR_END: upstream

% ANCHOR: older
% older X Y: X is next older than Y.
pred older o:critter, o:critter.
older otter heron.
older heron duck.
older duck  frog.
older frog  fish.
% ANCHOR_END: older

% ANCHOR: legs
pred legs o:critter, o:int.
legs algae 0.
legs fly   6.
legs snail 0.
legs frog  4.
legs fish  0.
legs heron 2.
legs duck  2.
legs otter 4.
% ANCHOR_END: legs
